    "title": "Judge sentences 'scholar-activist' to 20 years in prison for firebombing UC Berkeley cop car - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Student Reporters ,\n14 hours ago Casey Goonan, a 'scholar-activist', was sentenced to nearly 20 years in prison for firebombing a UC Berkeley police car and other arson acts, which occurred in June 2024. The sentence exceeded the prosecution's request of 15 years, with Goonan also ordered to pay nearly $100,000 in fines for his violent acts, inspired by political motives related to the conflict in Gaza. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
